WEBPAGE: play.google.com_store_apps_details_id_com.liftango.pur

 Purdue Campus Transit App Overview
The Purdue University Campus Transit app, developed by Liftango, is designed to assist users in finding the best bus routes, requesting on-demand rides, and receiving real-time transit updates. The app is particularly useful for students and staff traveling across campus, to classes, or to the airport. It has over 1,000 downloads and is rated 1.1 stars based on 17 reviews. The app is suitable for everyone and was last updated on November 19, 2025.


__________________________________________________
 Data Safety Information
The app emphasizes data safety, stating that it does not share data with third parties. However, it may collect data types such as location and personal information. The data is encrypted during transit, and users have the option to request data deletion. The developer may update these practices over time.


__________________________________________________
 User Ratings and Reviews
The app has received mixed reviews from users:
- **Jackson Dayhoff (November 13, 2025)**: Reports numerous bugs causing crashes and inaccurate pickup times, leading to long waits for rides. He expresses frustration over drivers leaving early.
- **Justin Kim (August 28, 2025)**: Initially faced access issues but received prompt support from Liftango. He appreciates the app's functionality but questions its necessity given the previous free transit options provided by Purdue.
- **Alyssa Mitton (October 9, 2025)**: Struggles with ride setup and notes that drivers are frequently late.


__________________________________________________
 Recent Updates
The app has undergone bug fixes and performance improvements to enhance user experience.


__________________________________________________
 Additional Apps by Liftango
Liftango has developed several other transit-related apps, including:
- Steamboat Carpool (3.3 stars)
- Northeastern University Redeye (1.2 stars)
- MyBlue North Central RTD (3.6 stars)
- BCGo Calhoun County (3.5 stars)
- I-Go City of Ionia (3.5 stars)


__________________________________________________

__________________________________________________
 Context
This information is relevant for users considering downloading the Purdue Campus Transit app or those seeking to understand its features and limitations. It also serves as a resource for Purdue University students and staff who rely on campus transit services.
