================WEBPAGE: 2977=================

WEBPAGE: www.purduecampustransit.com

 Purdue University Campus Transit Overview
The Purdue University Campus Transit app is designed to assist users in finding the best bus routes, requesting on-demand rides, and receiving real-time transit updates. It serves students and visitors traveling to various locations, including classes, the airport, and around campus. The app is available for download to facilitate these services.


__________________________________________________
 Service Hours
**Fixed Route Loops (Day)**
- **Days:** Monday - Friday
- **Time:** 07:00 AM - 7:00 PM
- **Routes:** Ross-Ade Loop, Purdue Mall Loop, and Discovery Park Loop, servicing north, central, and south campus stops.

**On-Demand Service (Day)**
- **Days:** Monday - Friday
- **Time:** 07:00 AM - 7:00 PM
- **Details:** Scheduled transport to/from approved campus locations via the transit app.

**On-Demand Service (Evening)**
- **Days:** Monday - Friday
- **Time:** 07:00 PM - 12:00 AM
- **Details:** Scheduled transport to/from approved campus locations via the transit app.

**On-Demand Service (Weekend)**
- **Days:** Sunday
- **Time:** 4:00 PM - 9:00 PM
- **Details:** Scheduled transport to/from approved campus locations via the transit app.


__________________________________________________
 Locations Served
**On-Demand Locations:** 
- Specific approved campus locations are available for on-demand rides, which can be viewed on the app.

**Fixed Route Locations:**
- Fixed routes cover major campus areas, ensuring accessibility to key locations.


__________________________________________________
 Frequently Asked Questions
**How can I use Purdue Campus Transit?**
- Users can access the Purdue Transportation website at [purduecampustransit.com](http://purduecampustransit.com) or contact the Transportation Information Center at 888-403-4305 for assistance.

**How are rides determined?**
- When a user requests an on-demand ride, the system checks for nearby fixed-route shuttles that can accommodate the trip. If a suitable shuttle is available, users are directed to board it for a quicker ride. If not, an on-demand ride is provided to ensure efficient transport.


__________________________________________________
 Contact Information
- **Phone:** 888-403-4304
- **Email:** purduetransit@metropolis.io
- **Mobile Application:** Available for download to access transit services.


__________________________________________________

