   - **Outbound**: From Fellows, buses will turn right on Broadway, left on Carroll, left on Haney, right on Fellows, resuming regular route.
   - **Inbound**: From Fellows, buses will turn left on Ohio, right on Carroll, right on Sample, left on Fellows, resuming regular route.

3. **Route 13 Detour**:
   - **Outbound**: From Eddy, buses will turn right on Campeau, left on Jacob, right on Corby, resuming regular route.
   - **Inbound**: From Corby, buses will turn left on Jacob, right on Campeau, right on Arthur, left on Corby, resuming regular route.

4. **Route 30 Detour**:
   - **Outbound**: From Lincolnway, buses will turn right on Cedar, left on 4th, left on Merrifield, right on Lincolnway, resuming regular route.
   - **Inbound**: From Lincolnway, buses will turn left on Merrifield, right on 4th, right on Cedar, left on Lincolnway, resuming regular route.

5. **Mishawaka School Trippers**:
   - AM Twin Branch & PM Twin Branch/Reverewood: Due to road closure on Vistula, buses will adjust routes accordingly.

6. **Notre Dame Home Game Detours**:
   - **#5 North Michigan**: Buses will bypass Saint Mary’s College starting with the 2:33 p.m. departure from South Street Station. The 5:33 p.m. departure will be canceled.
