Final Answer:
To travel off-campus using CityBus at Purdue University, you can register and set up payment for
your pass as follows:  1. **Registration and Pass Purchase**: For the fall 2025 semester, the cost
of off-campus passes has been subsidized by Purdue University, reducing the price from $99 to $49.
To obtain your pass, visit the CityBus website for the most current information and purchasing
options.  2. **Payment**: You will need to set up payment online through the CityBus website.
Specific instructions for registering and paying for the pass will be provided there as well.  3.
**Additional Information**: If you have further questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out
to the Purdue University Parking office via email at parking@purdue.edu or call (765) 494-4600.
Remember, it’s best to check the latest updates directly on the CityBus or Purdue Parking websites,
as availability and processes might change.
